    "text color" : "[0.13725490868091583, 0.12156862765550613, 0.125490203499794]",
    "content" : "poets”. He is a dandy, a preening bon viveur, in love with his own voice.Hewritesstoriesandmusic reviews and likes to ﬂirt with his hostessesinthesmartestsalons."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
